47
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:59,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For the 1st battle,</font>

48
00:02:00,390 --> 00:02:03,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akado Yoroi and Uchiha Sasuke
have been selected.</font>

49
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No objections, right?</font>

50
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:07,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Right!
— No!</font>

51
