<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, please begin.</font>

67
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:28,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... my Chakra...</font>

68
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:32,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You just noticed now...?</font>

69
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:44,340
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Super Eyebrows Jealous!</font>

70
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:44,340
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">"Lions Barrage" is Born!</font>

71
00:04:08,010 --> 00:04:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... my Chakra...</font>

72
00:04:13,140 --> 00:04:14,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You just noticed now...?</font>

73
00:04:21,940 --> 00:04:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... Yoroi has unorthodox ability
to absorb Chakra.</font>

74
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:30,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a magnificent art that
absorbs spiritual and physical energy</font>

75
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:34,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">simply by holding his palm against
an opponent's body.</font>

76
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:40,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And, if all of your Chakra
is absorbed, Sasuke-kun,</font>

77
00:04:41,210 --> 00:04:45,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'll be forced to rely upon
the power of my Curse Mark...</font>

78
00:04:51,470 --> 00:04:56,560
