<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

99
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:40,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't afford to be inattentive!</font>

100
00:06:42,790 --> 00:06:44,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll finish you with this!</font>

101
