<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my...!</font>

104
00:07:16,080 --> 00:07:16,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

105
00:07:17,410 --> 00:07:18,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

106
00:07:23,670 --> 00:07:27,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But then... from here on is my original.</font>

107
