<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

114
00:08:23,940 --> 00:08:28,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Sasuke!
Don't be looking so lame!</font>

115
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think they'd be worried about me...</font>

116
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this it...?</font>

117
00:08:37,740 --> 00:08:41,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't be swallowed up...
by this thing...</font>

118
00:08:41,830 --> 00:08:42,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

119
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:55,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Curse Mark receded!?</font>

120
00:08:58,390 --> 00:08:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I go!</font>

121
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:05,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're weak!</font>

122
00:09:08,730 --> 00:09:09,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're weak.</font>

123
00:09:21,490 --> 00:09:22,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not done, yet!</font>

124
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lions Barrage!</font>

125
00:09:54,490 --> 00:09:56,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to check.</font>

126
00:10:17,550 --> 00:10:19,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm stopping the match from
going any further...</font>

127
00:10:20,930 --> 00:10:25,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, the winner of the
first battle, Uchiha Sasuke...</font>

128
00:10:26,100 --> 00:10:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">passes the preliminaries!</font>

129
00:10:28,350 --> 00:10:29,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes!</font>

130
00:10:44,950 --> 00:10:47,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well. Good job...</font>

131
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:53,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Before that Lions Barrage,</font>

132
00:10:53,670 --> 00:10:55,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your movements were that
of Guy's Taijutsu...</font>

133
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:59,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you copied it with the Sharingan</font>

134
00:10:59,300 --> 00:11:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when you wrangled that one time
with that Lee kid?</font>

135
00:11:06,850 --> 00:11:11,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke! You, you...</font>

136
00:11:11,310 --> 00:11:13,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">won in a lame way!</font>

137
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:16,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look at you, all battered up!
You idiot!</font>

138
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:18,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, that useless...</font>

139
00:11:22,450 --> 00:11:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... Thank goodness.</font>

140
00:11:25,330 --> 00:11:27,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, I'll win, too!</font>

141
00:11:31,710 --> 00:11:35,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee... Because of you,
I've managed to save my neck.</font>

142
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:37,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things would've gotten hairy</font>

143
00:11:37,670 --> 00:11:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if I hadn't seen your technique
in close-quarters combat.</font>

144
00:11:48,770 --> 00:11:52,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it doesn't appear to be a technique
that I can use heavily.</font>

145
00:11:53,350 --> 00:11:59,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... So before, he copied a part
of the technique I only used once?</font>

146
00:12:01,530 --> 00:12:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan!</font>

147
00:12:07,450 --> 00:12:09,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's your ability...</font>

148
00:12:10,250 --> 00:12:12,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun... you're quite a person.</font>

149
00:12:13,210 --> 00:12:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You get rapidly stronger...</font>

150
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:19,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I kind of... feel a bit of fear.</font>

151
00:12:24,220 --> 00:12:27,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For a sequence of
high-speed Taijutsu Lotus movements,</font>

152
00:12:27,510 --> 00:12:30,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's impossible to acquire this
without training</font>

153
00:12:30,350 --> 00:12:32,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that whittles away flesh and blood.</font>

154
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:34,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how much you
use the Sharingan,</font>

155
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:37,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it can't just be mastered in
a short space of time...</font>

156
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:41,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, his idea for that
finishing move...</font>

157
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:49,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kakashi... this boy reminds me
of when you were a kid...</font>

158
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:57,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Last year's number one rookie
was Hyuga Neji.</font>

159
00:12:58,630 --> 00:13:01,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This year's number one rookie
is Uchiha Sasuke.</font>

160
00:13:02,590 --> 00:13:04,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder which one is stronger...?</font>

161
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:09,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really, he's something else.</font>

162
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:13,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he'd develop the true power
of the Sharingan in situation like this...</font>

163
00:13:14,890 --> 00:13:18,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's most to be feared...
is the Uchiha ability?</font>

164
00:13:23,690 --> 00:13:24,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was surprising...</font>

165
00:13:25,490 --> 00:13:27,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he brought the Curse Mark
that was getting out of control</font>

166
00:13:27,490 --> 00:13:29,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">into submission with his will...</font>

167
00:13:37,170 --> 00:13:39,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsk. Again?</font>

168
00:13:41,170 --> 00:13:43,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It just make it more interesting!</font>

169
00:13:44,170 --> 00:13:47,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! He is Sasuke-kun after all...</font>

170
00:13:48,390 --> 00:13:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is as far as we'll go...</font>

171
00:13:51,060 --> 00:13:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm hungry...</font>

172
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:54,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wow!</font>

173
00:13:55,980 --> 00:13:57,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing special.</font>

174
00:14:01,820 --> 00:14:04,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Magnificent...</font>

175
00:14:08,990 --> 00:14:10,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke...</font>

176
00:14:10,660 --> 00:14:14,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We medics will give you
the best of treatment.</font>

177
00:14:14,950 --> 00:14:17,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys are out of your territory.</font>

178
00:14:17,500 --> 00:14:18,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

179
00:14:18,620 --> 00:14:20,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll take him under my care...</font>

180
00:14:22,290 --> 00:14:24,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, I'll take you into the back...</font>

181
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:27,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and seal the Curse Mark.</font>

182
00:14:27,420 --> 00:14:29,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can we wait until
the preliminaries are over?!</font>

183
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:32,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to watch the matches
of those who will remain in the main battle.</font>

184
00:14:32,510 --> 00:14:33,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

185
00:14:34,310 --> 00:14:35,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get so heated.</font>

186
00:14:36,230 --> 00:14:37,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we let things be
any further,</font>

187
00:14:37,390 --> 00:14:39,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the situation might become irrevocable.</font>

188
00:14:40,150 --> 00:14:42,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't accommodate you anymore.</font>

189
00:14:44,230 --> 00:14:45,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, come on...</font>

190
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:52,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

191
00:15:00,290 --> 00:15:00,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?</font>

192
00:15:25,070 --> 00:15:28,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan... Speaking of which,
during the match...</font>

193
00:15:28,530 --> 00:15:31,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">did you see something that looked
like a strange wound on Sasuke's neck?</font>

194
00:15:32,030 --> 00:15:32,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

195
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:37,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please promise me...</font>

196
00:15:38,200 --> 00:15:40,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say anything about
this bruise to Naruto.</font>

197
00:15:40,460 --> 00:15:41,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

198
00:15:42,830 --> 00:15:45,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen... this is also teamwork.</font>

199
00:15:45,710 --> 00:15:48,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't do to have him
unnecessarily worried.</font>

200
00:15:50,220 --> 00:15:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I don't know either.</font>

201
00:15:53,430 --> 00:15:54,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

202
00:15:57,680 --> 00:15:59,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm, now then...</font>

203
00:16:00,060 --> 00:16:02,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will get right to it and
begin the second match.</font>

