300
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Abumi Zaku</font></font></b></font>

301
00:16:23,420 --> 00:16:25,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Aburame Shino</font></font></b></font>

302
00:16:27,340 --> 00:16:28,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which weakling is it?!</font>

303
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:40,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Both of you, come forward.</font>

304
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:47,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We will now begin the second match.</font>

305
00:16:51,490 --> 00:16:53,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the Sound Ninja...</font>

306
00:16:54,150 --> 00:16:56,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The guy who had both
his arms broken by Sasuke-kun!</font>

307
00:17:02,450 --> 00:17:04,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems like you're proud
of your arms...</font>

308
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:05,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

309
00:17:07,420 --> 00:17:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Stop it!</font>

310
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:21,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's going to fight with those arms?</font>

311
00:17:24,350 --> 00:17:26,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Shino-kun is going to be okay...</font>

312
00:17:26,600 --> 00:17:29,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's fine. He's strong!</font>

313
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:30,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?</font>

314
00:17:31,150 --> 00:17:33,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd square off with anybody except him...</font>

315
00:17:36,660 --> 00:17:38,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, please begin.</font>

316
00:17:39,410 --> 00:17:41,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now, Zaku...</font>

317
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:43,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How you fight will be a sight to see...</font>

318
00:18:02,600 --> 00:18:06,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you fight here,
you'll be finished...</font>

319
00:18:07,020 --> 00:18:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Withdraw!</font>

320
00:18:12,270 --> 00:18:15,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somehow, this one still works, so...</font>

321
00:18:19,910 --> 00:18:22,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One arm is enough to take care of you!</font>

322
00:18:26,910 --> 00:18:29,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't beat me with
just one arm.</font>

323
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop pestering me!</font>

324
00:18:34,380 --> 00:18:35,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take this!</font>

325
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:37,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Slicing Sound Wave!</font>

326
00:19:11,420 --> 00:19:12,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

327
00:19:14,250 --> 00:19:16,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there.
It'll be over right away.</font>

328
00:19:29,060 --> 00:19:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Curse Sealing!</font>

329
00:19:57,460 --> 00:20:00,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next time, even if that Curse Mark
starts kicking in again...</font>

330
00:20:01,590 --> 00:20:04,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the power of this Curse Sealing
should suppress it.</font>

331
00:20:06,810 --> 00:20:12,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, this Sealing Jutsu makes
the strength of your will its foundation.</font>

332
00:20:13,560 --> 00:20:16,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If something happens like
you not believing in your own strength</font>

333
00:20:16,190 --> 00:20:18,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and that will were to weaken...</font>

334
00:20:19,360 --> 00:20:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Curse Mark will
once again start to rage.</font>

335
00:20:27,530 --> 00:20:28,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of character.</font>

336
00:20:28,830 --> 00:20:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears he's quite tired...</font>

337
00:20:31,250 --> 00:20:34,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think you've become able to
handle Sealing Jutsu...</font>

338
00:20:36,670 --> 00:20:39,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've grown, eh, Kakashi...?</font>

339
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:45,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

340
00:20:53,560 --> 00:20:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see, Kakashi-kun.</font>

341
00:20:58,900 --> 00:20:59,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru...</font>

342
00:21:05,340 --> 00:21:10,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

343
00:21:05,340 --> 00:21:10,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

344
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

345
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

346
00:21:19,070 --> 00:21:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

347
00:21:19,070 --> 00:21:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

348
00:21:28,320 --> 00:21:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

349
00:21:28,320 --> 00:21:37,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

350
00:21:37,390 --> 00:21:43,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

351
00:21:37,390 --> 00:21:43,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">or else I'll cry</font></b></font></font></font>

352
00:21:43,300 --> 00:21:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mawari o mimawasa naku temo</font></b></font></font>

353
00:21:43,300 --> 00:21:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">You won't have to search around you</font></b></font></font></font>

354
00:21:47,470 --> 00:21:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mou iin da yo</font></b></font></font>

355
00:21:47,470 --> 00:21:51,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">it's all ok now</font></b></font></font></font>

356
00:21:51,310 --> 00:22:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kono to no naka ni wa minna ga iru kara</font></b></font></font>

357
00:21:51,310 --> 00:22:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">everyone is inside this hand</font></b></font></font></font>

358
00:22:00,250 --> 00:22:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">naki taku natte nige taku natte</font></b></font></font>

359
00:22:00,250 --> 00:22:05,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you want to cry, and you want to run away</font></b></font></font>

360
00:22:05,520 --> 00:22:09,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">shiawase o wasure te te shimatta ra</font></b></font></font>

361
00:22:05,520 --> 00:22:09,990
